WEBVTT

00:00:00.749 --> 00:00:02.350 line:87%
They grow up so fast.

00:00:03.591 --> 00:00:05.010 line:87%
A closet can grow with them,

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:07.550 line:87%
from tiny outfits
to teen-sized clothes.

00:00:08.522 --> 00:00:11.020 line:87%
That can mean fewer extra
dressers along the way.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.250 line:87%
Plan your growing closet
with SKI.
